{"context": "published", "host": "www.josephsmithpapers.org", "showHeader": true, "footerStyle": "mini", "statusCode": 200, "uri": "letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830", "page": "8", "is404": false, "gallery": [{"image": "/52/52_ppallen_196_thumb.jpg", "page": "1", "label": "196", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/1"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_197_thumb.jpg", "page": "2", "label": "197", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/2"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_198_thumb.jpg", "page": "3", "label": "198", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/3"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_199_thumb.jpg", "page": "4", "label": "199", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/4"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_200_thumb.jpg", "page": "5", "label": "200", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/5"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_201_thumb.jpg", "page": "6", "label": "201", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/6"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_202_thumb.jpg", "page": "7", "label": "202", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/7"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_203_thumb.jpg", "page": "8", "label": "203", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/8"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_204_thumb.jpg", "page": "9", "label": "204", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/9"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_205_thumb.jpg", "page": "10", "label": "205", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/10"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_206_thumb.jpg", "page": "11", "label": "206", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/11"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_207_thumb.jpg", "page": "12", "label": "207", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/12"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_208_thumb.jpg", "page": "13", "label": "208", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/13"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_209_thumb.jpg", "page": "14", "label": "209", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/14"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_210_thumb.jpg", "page": "15", "label": "210", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/15"}, {"image": "/52/52_ppallen_211_thumb.jpg", "page": "16", "label": "211", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830/16"}], "tableOfContents": [], "summary": {"uri": "letter-to-the-church-in-colesville-2-december-1830", "series": "JSPPD", "urlTitleValue": "JSPPD1", "documentSeriesTitle": "Letter to the Church in Colesville, 2 December 1830", "editorialPageNumber": "203", "isPageNumberPresent": true, "searchUrl": "/published/jsp/searchable/papers/26086/26086-0008.xml", "clearText": "<html><head></head><body><div class=\"indent continuation wasptag\"> rejoice. Behold the prophecies of the <a href=\"/paper-summary/book-of-mormon-1830\" class=\"reference\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/book-of-mormon-1830\" poptitle=\"Book of Mormon, 1830\">Book of Mormon</a> are fulfilling as fast as time can bring it about. The Spirit of the Living God is upon me therefore who will say that I shall not prophecy. The time is soon at hand that we shall have to flee whithersoever the Lord will, for safety,<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"1266930387374851808\"><a href=\"#1266930387374851808\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans14\"><span id=\"documenttrans14\">14</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">A <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-30-december-1830-dc-37\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-30-december-1830-dc-37\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 30\nDecember 1830 [D&amp;C 37]\">revelation</a> four weeks later, on 30 December 1830, directed members to leave their <a href=\"/place/new-york\" class=\"referenceInPop\">New York</a> homes and “assemble together” in <a href=\"/place/ohio\" class=\"referenceInPop\">Ohio</a>. (<a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-30-december-1830-dc-37\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-30-december-1830-dc-37\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 30\nDecember 1830 [D&amp;C 37]\">Revelation, 30 Dec. 1830</a> [D&amp;C 37:3].)</p><hr></div></div></aside> Fear not those who are making you an offender for a word<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"17320610803705094134\"><a href=\"#17320610803705094134\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans15\"><span id=\"documenttrans15\">15</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Isaiah 29:21; and Book of Mormon, 1830 ed., <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=118\" class=\"externalLink\">112</a> [2 Nephi 27:32].</p><hr></div></div></aside> but be faithful in witnessing unto a crooked and a perverse generation,<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"12683588317748827148\"><a href=\"#12683588317748827148\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans16\"><span id=\"documenttrans16\">16</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See, for example, Deuteronomy 32:5; Philippians 2:15; and <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-4-november-1830-dc-34\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-4-november-1830-dc-34\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 4 November 1830\n[D&amp;C 34]\">Revelation, 4 Nov. 1830</a> [D&amp;C 34:6].</p><hr></div></div></aside> that the day of the coming of our Lord and Savior [p. 203]</div></body></html>", "expandedText": "<html><head></head><body><div class=\"indent continuation wasptag\"> rejoice. Behold the prophecies <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>of the <a href=\"/paper-summary/book-of-mormon-1830\" class=\"reference\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/book-of-mormon-1830\" poptitle=\"Book of Mormon, 1830\">Book of Mormon</a> are <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>fulfilling as fast as time can <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>bring it about. The Spirit <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>of the Living God is upon me <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>therefore who will say that <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>I shall not prophecy. The <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>time is soon at hand that <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>we shall have to flee whither<span class=\"line-break hyphenate\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>soever the Lord will, for safety,<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"7523398591176597186\"><a href=\"#7523398591176597186\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans14\"><span id=\"documenttrans14\">14</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">A <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-30-december-1830-dc-37\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-30-december-1830-dc-37\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 30\nDecember 1830 [D&amp;C 37]\">revelation</a> four weeks later, on 30 December 1830, directed members to leave their <a href=\"/place/new-york\" class=\"referenceInPop\">New York</a> homes and “assemble together” in <a href=\"/place/ohio\" class=\"referenceInPop\">Ohio</a>. (<a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-30-december-1830-dc-37\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-30-december-1830-dc-37\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 30\nDecember 1830 [D&amp;C 37]\">Revelation, 30 Dec. 1830</a> [D&amp;C 37:3].)</p><hr></div></div></aside> <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>Fear not those who are making <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>you an offender for a word<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"4852500216888401007\"><a href=\"#4852500216888401007\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans15\"><span id=\"documenttrans15\">15</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Isaiah 29:21; and Book of Mormon, 1830 ed., <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=118\" class=\"externalLink\">112</a> [2 Nephi 27:32].</p><hr></div></div></aside> <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>but be faithful in witnessing <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>unto a crooked and a perverse <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>generation,<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"14142577126923149812\"><a href=\"#14142577126923149812\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans16\"><span id=\"documenttrans16\">16</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See, for example, Deuteronomy 32:5; Philippians 2:15; and <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-4-november-1830-dc-34\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-4-november-1830-dc-34\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 4 November 1830\n[D&amp;C 34]\">Revelation, 4 Nov. 1830</a> [D&amp;C 34:6].</p><hr></div></div></aside> that <span class=\"deleted\">thy</span> the day of the <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>coming of our Lord and Savior [p. 203]</div></body></html>", "ca